## HARD RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

1. ONLY `lat-engine` mutates global state
2. ALL subsystems return `Vec<Event>`
3. NO subsystem can call another subsystem
4. NO circular dependencies
5. ONLY `lat-protocol` is shared dependency
6. NO `block_on`
7. Snapshot is immutable value copy (NO references, NO Arc inside snapshot)

